":null,\"reference_feature_id\":null,\"measurement_axis\":\"z\",\"critical\":true,\"notes\":\"ABSOLUTE Z extent = BASE_THICKNESS_Z (10) + LEG_ABOVE_BASE_Z (30) = 40. User text said '10 mm tall'; reconciled to a buildable L-profile with a 10 mm thick base and 10 mm thick leg (total height 40 mm).\"},{\"id\":\"single-body\",\"kind\":\"single_body\",\"description\":\"The horizontal base and the vertical leg MUST fuse into exactly one connected solid.\",\"nominal\":null,\"tolerance_upper\":0.0,\"tolerance_lower\":0.0,\"face_selector_expression\":null,\"edge_selector_expression\":null,\"reference_feature_id\":null,\"measurement_axis\":null,\"critical\":true,\"notes\":\"Verify solid count == 1 after union of base and leg.\"},{\"id\":\"water-tightness\",\"kind\":\"water_tightness\",\"description\":\"Final mesh MUST be a closed, manifold, water-tight solid (no open edges).\",\"nominal\":null,\"tolerance_upper\":0.0,\"tolerance_lower\":0.0,\"face_selector_expression\":null,\"edge_selector_expression\":null,\"reference_feature_id\":null,\"measurement_axis\":null,\"critical\":true,\"notes\":\"Check is_valid() / closed shell with zero free edges.\"}],\"functional_requirements\":[\"L-bracket meant to join a vertical surface to a horizontal surface at 90 degrees.\",\"M4 clearance holes (Ø4.5 mm) for M4 fasteners — one through the vertical leg, one through the horizontal base.\",\"Base thickness 10 mm and leg thickness 10 mm provide rigid, load-bearing sections.\",\"Non-geometric assumption: request did not specify material or process; defaulted to 3D-printed PLA for a general-purpose bracket.\",\"Assumption: the '10 mm tall' overall figure in the request is reconciled with the stated 10 mm base and 10 mm leg thicknesses as a coherent L-profile of total height 40 mm (base 10 + leg-above-base 30).\"],\"manufacturing_method\":\"3d_print_fdm\",\"special_features\":[\"The whole part MUST be symmetric about the vertical plane at Y = SYMMETRY_PLANE_Y (Y = BASE_WIDTH_Y/2 = 10): every feature's Y extent mirrors about that plane.\",\"The vertical leg MUST occupy X = LEG_X_START to X = LEG_X_END (X = 30 to 40) and MUST NOT be placed at the X=0 end.\",\"The vertical leg MUST be a plate of thickness LEG_THICKNESS_X (10) in X, rising in +Z from the base top face (Z = BASE_THICKNESS_Z) up to Z = OVERALL_Z.\",\"The horizontal base MUST be a plate of thickness BASE_THICKNESS_Z (10) in Z spanning X = 0 to BASE_LENGTH_X and Y = 0 to BASE_WIDTH_Y, with its bottom face at Z = 0.\",\"The leg base hole MUST penetrate the vertical leg along the X axis (through the 10 mm LEG_THICKNESS_X), NOT along Y or Z.\",\"The base hole MUST penetrate the horizontal base along the Z axis (through the 10 mm BASE_THICKNESS_Z), NOT along X or Y.\",\"Both holes MUST be M4 clearance holes of diameter CLEARANCE_HOLE_DIA_M4 (4.5 mm) — clearance, NOT tapped/threaded.\",\"The base hole center MUST be located at (BASE_HOLE_X, BASE_HOLE_Y) = (10, 10), i.e. 10 mm from the base free edge (X=0) and centered 10 mm from each side edge (Y=0 and Y=20).\",\"The leg hole center MUST be located at (Y, Z) = (LEG_HOLE_Y, LEG_HOLE_Z) = (10, 30), i.e. centered 10 mm from each side edge (Y=0 and Y=20) and 10 mm below the leg top edge (Z=OVERALL_Z).\",\"The vertical leg and horizontal base MUST overlap/fuse into one connected solid at the X=30..40 corner; the leg MUST NOT float separately from the base.\"],\"user_request_raw\":\"Read the following part request and produce a build123d script that models the part. The request is: 'Create an L-bracket with overall dimensions 40 mm long, 20 mm wide, and 10 mm tall. The bracket has a vertical leg 10 mm thick and a horizontal base 10 mm thick. There are two M4 clearance holes, one in the vertical leg and one in the horizontal base, each centered 10 mm from the nearest edges.'\",\"spec_version\":1}\nQA report: {\"cad_brief_id\":\"(coder-failure)\",\"engine_a\":{\"engine_name\":\"cadpy_analysis\",\"results\":[],\"summary\":\"\",\"warnings\":[],\"errors\":[],\"ra